  "design_invariants": [
    "D03 is stateless over current D04Evaluation and DecisionContext",
    "schema-invalid or semantically invalid input commits no D03Decision",
    "BLOCKED is schema-valid actionable transition plus execution unavailable only and never queues",
    "primary reason is resolved target/control rule reason",
    "supporting reasons are target detail then transition then ordered overlays, duplicate-free and excluding primary",
