    "candidate lineage follows only target-causing current D04 candidate authority",
    "direction source is D04 candidate.path_direction; direct D02 input is zero",
    "disabled controls preserve actual position and create no deferred target",
    "feed and replay transports use identical D03 policy",
    "future observations, outcomes, P&L, benchmarks, and reserve are prohibited"
